  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Portfolio of 36 fine press broadsides, most numbered and signed, composed to honor the memory of William "Bill" Stewart, founder and purveyor of Vamp &amp; Tramp, Booksellers. One-page essay by Bill Stewart entitled "Why artists' books: a personal digression on artists' books" laid in.</subfield>
  </datafield>
